# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# SaleTouch 2.0 · 公开代码仓库
#
# 本仓库只放纯代码。设计文档、调研、业务知识在平级的私有目录中：
#   ../salestouch2.0DevelopWorkspace/   设计 / 调研 / 笔记
#   ../salestouch2.0Plugin/             方法论 / 模板 / 校准 / 知识包
#
# 以下规则是「防回流」——防止有人把私有内容复制进来。
# 配合 tools/precommit-guard.sh 使用（路径 + 文件名 + 内容敏感词）。
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── ① 非代码内容（一律不进本仓库）──
/docs/
/design/
/research/
/notes/
/drafts/
/private/
/salestouch2.0Plugin/
/salestouch2.0DevelopWorkspace/

# ── ② 知识资产与制品 ──
/packs/
/seedpacks/
*.pack
*.pack.sig
*knowhow-pack*
*knowledge-pack*
*.promptpack
*.evalpack
*.templatepack
/calibration/
/tenant-maps/
*customer-map*
*calibration-export*
*.design.md

# ── ③ 客户数据（任何形态）──
/customer-data/
*.recording
*.transcript
*.wav
*.mp3
/analytics-export/
*.dump
*.sql.gz

# ── ④ 凭证 ──
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
secrets/
credentials*

# ── ⑤ 常规 ──
node_modules/
dist/
build/
coverage/
*.log
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
tmp/
.cache/
